%% Diagrama 3: Sequência de Consulta de Extrato
%% Demonstrates cursor-based pagination with masking

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    %% Participants
    actor Client as 👤 Client
    participant API as 🚀 BankingCore.API
    participant Auth as 🔐 JWT Middleware
    participant UseCase as 🎯 GetStatementUseCase
    participant Repo as 📊 TransactionRepository<br/>(Dapper)
    participant DB as 🗄️ MySQL 8.0<br/>(VIEW)
    
    %% Initial request (first page)
    Client->>+API: GET /api/accounts/{id}/statement<br/>?limit=50&startDate=2026-01-01
    API->>+Auth: Verify JWT + account ownership
    Auth-->>-API: ✅ Authorized
    
    API->>+UseCase: GetStatement(accountId, dateRange)
    UseCase->>+Repo: QueryStatement(accountId, filter)
    
    Note over Repo,DB: Dapper raw SQL for performance<br/>Bypass ORM overhead
    
    Repo->>+DB: SELECT * FROM vw_account_statement<br/>WHERE account_id = @accountId<br/>AND date >= @startDate<br/>ORDER BY date DESC<br/>LIMIT 50
    
    Note right of DB: View applies masking:<br/>fn_mask_document(CPF)<br/>fn_mask_name(receiver)<br/>(compliance with RN04)
    
    DB-->>-Repo: [Transaction[], totalCount]
    Repo-->>-UseCase: StatementResult
    
    Note over UseCase: Calculate next cursor:<br/>last transaction_id<br/>hasMore = count == limit
    
    UseCase-->>-API: StatementResponse
    API-->>-Client: 200 OK
    Note right of Client: {<br/>  transactions: [...],<br/>  nextCursor: "12345",<br/>  hasMore: true,<br/>  totalCount: 250<br/>}
    
    %% Second page (cursor pagination)
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Client,DB: 📄 Pagination (Cursor-based)
        Client->>+API: GET /api/accounts/{id}/statement<br/>?cursor=12345&limit=50
        API->>+UseCase: GetStatement with cursor
        UseCase->>+Repo: QueryStatement with cursor
        Repo->>+DB: SELECT * FROM vw_account_statement<br/>WHERE account_id = @accountId<br/>AND transaction_id < @cursor<br/>ORDER BY date DESC<br/>LIMIT 50
        
        Note right of DB: Keyset pagination:<br/>O(1) lookup via index<br/>Consistent results<br/>No OFFSET performance penalty
        
        DB-->>-Repo: [Transaction[] (next 50)]
        Repo-->>-UseCase: StatementResult
        UseCase-->>-API: StatementResponse
        API-->>-Client: 200 OK
        Note right of Client: {<br/>  transactions: [...],<br/>  nextCursor: "12395",<br/>  hasMore: true<br/>}
    end
    
    %% Empty result
    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
        Note over Client,DB: 📭 Empty Result
        Client->>+API: GET /api/accounts/{id}/statement<br/>?cursor=99999&limit=50
        API->>+UseCase: GetStatement
        UseCase->>+Repo: QueryStatement
        Repo->>+DB: SELECT ...
        DB-->>-Repo: []
        Repo-->>-UseCase: Empty result
        UseCase-->>-API: StatementResponse
        API-->>-Client: 200 OK
        Note right of Client: {<br/>  transactions: [],<br/>  nextCursor: null,<br/>  hasMore: false<br/>}
    end
